# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its tables, please cite the two papers it was written for (preferred-citation and references) and the repository."
type: software
title: "ForwardRCS: forward real Compton scattering off the proton from dispersion relations"
abstract: "Python code for the empirical evaluation of the forward Compton scattering amplitudes of the proton, f(nu) and g(nu), from the total and helicity-difference photoabsorption cross sections by dispersion relations, with the Baldin, GDH and higher-order forward sum rules and the forward observables. It reproduces the evaluations of Gryniuk, Hagelstein and Pascalutsa (2015, 2016) and contains a 2026 update with global fits and new data."
